  "bodyHash": "e26c3d767ee664c6",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷你骷髅 (Tiny Skeletons)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 终于将幼年骷髅引入了《我的世界》！💀 既然有小僵尸，为什么不能有幼年骷髅呢？普通骷髅、流浪者、沼泽骷髅、焦黑骷髅以及凋灵骷髅现在都可以以迷你的形态生成，每种变体都拥有独特的行为、攻击方式和奖励。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可爱吗？有时候是。无害吗？绝对不。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自然生成：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 幼年骷髅变体将以 5% 的概率自然生成，就像小僵尸一样。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幼年骷髅：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在远处使用弓箭战斗，当你靠近时，它们会迅速切换成近战模式，使用木剑攻击。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❄️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幼年流浪者：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 投掷混合着小石子的冰冷雪球，造成少量伤害并将目标击退。击败它们后甚至可能掉落蓝冰。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🍄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幼年沼泽骷髅：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 从远处向敌人投掷蘑菇，造成轻微伤害并提供独特的蘑菇主题掉落物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏜️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幼年焦黑骷髅：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 向附近的敌人投掷沙块，可以作为获取沙子的便捷来源。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幼年凋灵骷髅：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 令人惊讶地胆小，当你接近时会逃跑，因为它们害怕你会偷走它们随身携带的凋灵骷髅头。击败它们可以确保获得骷髅头掉落物，或者用凋灵玫瑰进行交易。🌹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎁 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">独特奖励：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 几种幼年骷髅变体提供特殊的掉落物和获取有用资源的替代方法。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端和服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (Fabric 和 NeoForge)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持配置，可以直接通过游戏内的模组菜单进行设置（Fabric 版本需要安装 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，作者为 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 目录下，根据配置文件类型的不同，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。并非所有类型的配置文件都存在，具体取决于模组。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/daveyx0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Daveyx0</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 启发，其模组 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/primitive-mobs\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Primitive Mobs</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 中的骷髅战士启发了幼年骷髅的战斗行为。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/globox_z\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Globox_Z</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 提供了部分代码，用于在幼年骷髅背部渲染物品，灵感来自其模组 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backslot\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">BackSlot</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furgle\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Furgle</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 的启发，其模组 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/baby-mobs\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Baby Mobs</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 中的幼年凋灵骷髅携带骷髅头的设定。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-insights\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fast-item-frames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/combat-nouveau\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
